sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title YuPay — G2B game → catalog import (atomic, supplier-first)

    actor Admin
    participant SPA as Admin SPA
    participant API as integrations.import_game
    participant CAT as catalog (write layer)
    participant DB as Postgres

    Admin->>SPA: open /integrations/g2b/catalog
    SPA->>API: GET /catalog?supplier_slug=g2b&kind=game (+ mappings for badges)
    Admin->>SPA: pick game, set margin, select denominations

    Note over SPA: wizard pre-fetched cost/denominations + required_fields — no live G2B call on import

    SPA->>API: POST /g2b/import {game_code, new_brand|brand_id, product, margin_percent, denominations}
    API->>CAT: create_brand / get_brand
    API->>CAT: create_product (kind=top_up, supplier_hint=g2b, required_fields)
    API->>DB: SELECT existing sku_code IN (...) (structural idempotency)

    loop each selected denomination
        alt sku_code already exists
            Note over API: skip → skipped[]
        else new sku_code
            API->>CAT: create_sku (price = override ?? round(cost*(1+margin/100), 2))
            API->>DB: upsert sku_supplier_mapping (kind=game, external_product_id=game_code, external_variant_id=catalogue_name)
        end
    end

    Note over API,DB: service flushes only — route owns the transaction
    API->>DB: COMMIT (atomic — any error rolls the whole import back)
    API-->>SPA: 201 {brand_id, product_id, created_skus, created_mappings, skipped}
    SPA-->>Admin: toast + navigate /brands/:id
